{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09272","headline":"乘月过西郊渡 · 韦应物","name":"乘月过西郊渡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远山含紫氛，春野霭云暮。\n值此归时月，留连西涧渡。\n谬当文墨会，得与羣英遇。\n赏逐乱流翻，心将清景悟。\n行车俨未转，芳草空盈步。\n已举候亭火，犹爱村原树。\n还当守故扃，怅恨秉幽素。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09272.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09272","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}